# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# nest-project - root (monorepo orchestrator)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# This folder only orchestrates the frontend and backend workspaces
# via the root package.json scripts, so it does not load its own
# .env file. Each workspace loads its own environment:
#
#   backend/.env        (loaded by dotenv / @nestjs/config)
#   frontend/.env.local (loaded by Next.js)
#
# Copy the per-workspace .env.example files to .env / .env.local
# and adjust the values for your machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
